        "Description": "Good evening 47\r\rWe are sending you into Paris France at the Sanguine fashing how downtown. We need you to eliminate 5 targets who were involved in a child abduction back in one of the haven islands beach huts. The family have assigned us with the job and with a promise of a hefty payout. All you need to do is assasinate them in a discrete manor, and the money will be wired to you&apos;re account upon completion.\r\rGood luck 47\r\rRemake of Crystallcharr&apos;s PS5 contract",
